# Account names are fixed; their passwords come from .env (deploy-dev.sh).
#
# Cameras share one publish-only account. Each message still carries the
# camera's own API key, which the backend checks exactly like
# POST /ingest/ocr's X-Api-Key, so one camera cannot report for another.
# Write-only also means a camera cannot read other cameras' messages (keys).

user washon-backend
topic read washon/devices/+/ocr

user washon-camera
topic write washon/devices/+/ocr
